# Esc during ask_user_question cancels the whole exchange
# (PromptState.cancelQuestion -> AskUserReply{Cancelled:true}): the tool
# call ends as a declined-style error ("The user declined to answer.
# Proceed with your best judgement, or ask a different way."), not a
# hang and not a panic, and the model's next reply (scripted here) shows
# the turn kept going.
@faux testdata/faux/qa/tools-askuser-esc.yaml

WAITFOR /describe a task/ 20
TYPE decide how to fix the bug
KEY enter
WAITFOR /Which approach should I use\?/ 20
SHOT question-open
KEY esc
WAITFOR /The user declined to answer/ 20
SHOT cancelled
EXPECT /The user declined to answer\. Proceed with your best judgement, or ask a different way\./
WAITFOR /Alright, I.ll just pick one\./ 20
EXPECT_NOT /panic|goroutine/
